      "content": "it's easy to talk about hope, but you aren't the one hearing the drums outside the walls. you aren't the one feeling the nothingness in your stomach. it's just a matter of time until we're just... meat to them. if someone could just choose their own end, wouldn't that be better than being hunted? wouldn't that be the only way to stay human?",
